{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>買嘢飲送繡球花!蝶豆花打卡飲品</p><p>上環花藝咖啡店繡球花主題佈置</p><p>上環花藝咖啡店「太平」由7月17日至21日，將舖頭佈置成藍白色繡球花主題，環境超夢幻。店家更特別推出$100「繡球花配飲品套裝」，包一杯打卡特飲之外，客人仲可自由挑選大繡球花兩支，或細繡球花三支，將繡球花帶回家中！</p><p>期間限定藍白漸層特調飲品</p><p>店方更推出期間限定特調飲品「Butterfly Pea Coconut」，椰子蝶豆花的藍白雙色漸層，賣相打卡，完美襯托現場的藍白花海，各位女士們把握機會去打卡影靚相啦！</p><p>太平 地址：上環太平山街5號地舖 營業時間：星期一至日 10:00 – 18:00 官方IG：@taiping.hk 備註：期間限定繡球花主題佈置由7月17日至21日</p><p>【 每週爆紅話題，「新假期熱話」即時分享最有趣、最矚目社交潮流，如果你想推介獨家故事？DM我哋！】</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178435455370277613_11363391666a5b16fa769f6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178435455588054280_19729892646a5b16fc498f6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17843545577968869_7850589546a5b16fe2ad3d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178435455949453297_9117461676a5b16ffcfca7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178435456110512945_7157816166a5b1701784c4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178435456289677737_12158753196a5b170347fe5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178435456449941545_12574474586a5b1704d90ac.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-18T06:18:15.478502+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":443,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}